{title: 567 - Have Thine Own Way, Lord}
{artist: Seventh-day Adventist Hymnal}
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Eb}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{tag: Christian Life}
{tag: }

Verse 1:
[Eb]Have [Fm]Thine [Eb]own [Ab]way, [Eb]Lord! Have [Bb]Thine [Eb]own [Bb7]way!
Thou art the [Gm7]Pot[Bb7]ter, I [Eb]am [Bb]the [Eb]clay.
[Eb]Mold [Fm]me [Eb]and [Ab]make [Eb]Me [Eb7]after Thy [Ab]will,
While I am [Eb]waiting, [Bb7]Yield[Eb]ed [Bb7]and [Eb]still.

Verse 2:
[Eb]Have [Fm]thine [Eb]own [Ab]way, [Eb]Lord! [Bb]Have [Eb]thine [Bb7]own way!
[Gm7]Search [Bb7]me [Eb]and try [Bb]me, [Eb]Savior today!
[Eb]Wash [Fm]me [Eb]just [Ab]now, Lord, [Eb]wash [Eb7]me [Ab]just now,
[Eb]as [Bb7]in [Eb]thy presence [Bb7]humbly [Eb]I bow.

Verse 3:
[Eb]Have [Fm]thine [Eb]own [Ab]way, [Eb]Lord! [Bb]Have [Eb]thine [Bb7]own way!
[Gm7]Wounded [Bb7]and [Eb]weary, help [Bb]me [Eb]I pray!
[Eb][Fm]Power, [Eb]all [Ab]power, [Eb]surely [Eb7]is [Ab]thine!
[Eb]Touch [Bb7]me [Eb]and heal [Bb7]me, [Eb]Savior divine!

Verse 4:
[Eb]Have [Fm]thine [Eb]own [Ab]way, [Eb]Lord! [Bb]Have [Eb]thine [Bb7]own way!
[Gm7]Hold [Bb7]o'er [Eb]my [Bb]being [Eb]absolute sway.
[Eb]Fill [Fm]with [Eb]thy [Ab]Spirit [Eb]till [Eb7]all [Ab]shall see
[Eb]Christ [Bb7]only, [Eb]always, [Bb7]living [Eb]in me!
